...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down
grid-rows: 3

front: "브라우저 쪽" {
  class: group
  grid-columns: 2
  user: 사용자 { class: person }
  ui: ADK Web UI (adk web) { class: ext }
}

coordinator: 코디네이터 (multi_agent_researcher) { class: ours }

team: "코디네이터가 다루는 대상" {
  class: group
  grid-columns: 4
  research: 리서치 에이전트 (research_agent) { class: ours }
  summarizer: 요약 에이전트 (summarizer_agent) { class: ours }
  critic: 비평 에이전트 (critic_agent) { class: ours }
  gemini: Gemini API (gemini-3-flash-preview) { class: ext }
}

front.user -> front.ui: 연구 주제
front.ui -> coordinator: root_agent 실행
coordinator -> team.research: 도구 호출 후 응답 대기
coordinator -> team.summarizer: transfer_to_agent (복귀 없음)
coordinator -> team.critic: transfer_to_agent (복귀 없음)
team.summarizer -> team.critic: 동료 간 transfer_to_agent
team.research -> team.gemini: 모델 호출
coordinator -> team.gemini: 모델 호출
team.summarizer -> team.gemini: 모델 호출
team.critic -> team.gemini: 모델 호출
